{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_durnar_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_durnar_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"額外訓練","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_durnar_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"e6ce0003084996be916501ae7eed2b83ff714f209580fc61d333a51a7a4c9bfc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"坚雷对A1小队的战斗测试"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，A1預備小隊的新人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的例行訓練內容，到這裡就——結束了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜恭喜！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，原本你們剛來的時候練沒幾個小時就要死要活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看看現在，一個個還都還沒喘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"說明訓練效果還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，謝謝教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"米格魯！堅雷教官發言還沒結束，你怎麼可以——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦芬，我又不是杜賓，沒那麼多規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"大家平時訓練都很累了，這種時候就輕鬆一點，可以吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，越來越像杜賓了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是！——是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你看啊，腰板一挺，手往兩旁一貼，視線直勾勾對著我眼睛，這不就是杜賓嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"語調嘛，這個就不用我說了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"真的哦，一模一樣~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這也是件好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"和我當兵的時候不一樣，羅德島有個完整的教官團負責所有預備幹員的培訓，每個人都有他們的特點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我想不到的，他們就會察覺到並給你們補上一課，反之也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一來，每個預備幹員都能獲得接近全面的訓練課程，而不是讓個傻大兵來想所有事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"格瑞斯、法倫、杜賓，還有其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是處理教學課程還是一起上戰場，都是些值得信任的好夥計啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"加油把杜賓身上的東西都學過來好嗎，我們還挺想多一個助教的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官，謝謝教官關心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，提醒我訓練完以後找管理場地的人修整場地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好幾次都練忘了，結果回頭就被杜賓罵，唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎，芬，一定要提醒我啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"閒聊就到此為止了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"全體都有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"立——正！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正如大家所知的那樣，今天的例行訓練內容結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們的訓練時間還空出了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在接下來的時間裡，我將和大家一起進行愉快的對抗訓練！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（倒吸一口涼氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"唉？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"鑑於有幾位朋友還沒參與過對抗訓練的課程，所以呢，我會簡單講一下訓練內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"（完了，死定了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然聽上去挺花哨，但其實就是模擬實戰訓練，我會評估大家的作戰方式，然後給出優化方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）姐姐，你看看米格魯啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）別說話，先聽教官講完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊當然，這次和普通的對抗還是有區別的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——既然你們都在，那就當一對五的訓練賽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正好也讓我檢查一下各位的訓練成果和默契程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，大家先休息一會，放放鬆，吃塊糖什麼的，我也去做個準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"解散！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"芬！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我不知道啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"你們太緊張啦，又不是杜賓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷教官是不可怕啊，但，但格鬥對抗訓練時候的她完全是另外一回事啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷教官會參加近衛、重裝和先鋒幹員的近身對抗練習，這炎熔你是知道的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道那時候堅雷教官是怎麼樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"還能......怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"她會放下盾牌提著兩把劍暴錘我一個小時的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"唰唰唰像風一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是這樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前一直以為教官天天都很和善，不怎麼批評人，還會請大家吃好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次格鬥對抗訓練結束以後才知道......堅雷教官要是開罵了比杜賓教官還狠。幾輪打下來，槍都有點拿不穩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是持盾的那隻手，一旦拿了劍，揮下來真的像閃電那麼快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我知道了，大概就是和流星姐姐在訓練場裡對射那種感覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇，和流星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真行啊克洛絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，沒過一分鐘就中了五支訓練箭啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"好菜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，如果不想挨打，千萬，千萬不可以小瞧堅雷教官啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"她可是個老兵，要不是對哥倫比亞軍方有意見，現在還是在役士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她一會多帶把刀來，我們就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，我問問啊，今天早上有人因為外傷去醫療部擦藥水的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"每天來醫療部的人都特別多，擦傷淤青之類其實還，挺常見的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，這個很重要，幫忙想一想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上我在給病房裡的人換藥，沒有去坐診。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"但是聽蘇蘇洛說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"好像A4預備小隊所有人早上訓練結束後都去了一下外科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，是堅雷教官帶著去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"這有什麼聯繫嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到玫蘭莎和卡緹也沒能擋住教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"就算教官能一個人對付你們，但我們有五個人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"A4也有五個人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那有什麼，我們還是比A4要強的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧，芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊啊，是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"我們加油......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"加油！加油......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"你們好像沒什麼信心嘛，真有這麼可怕？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"全體都有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"列隊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，看來你們都準備好了，很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，能問個問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（克洛絲！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"問吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"您為什麼，多帶了把訓練劍啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這問題問的，當然是為了訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，剛剛休息的時候突然懷念起以前的戰鬥技巧，想找人試試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊當然，我和大家用的東西一樣，是訓練用裝備，沒帶自己改裝的電刃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你們最好重視點啊，別因為平時對你們和善就覺得實踐也會讓你們一手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不想挨打，就好好應戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"訓練手冊上對於突發應敵的步驟之前有看過嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次對抗我會面對你們開始，之後就要把整個場地利用起來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"愣著幹什麼，碰到敵人不需要警戒嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"啊是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"警戒！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，反應不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"既然是初戰，就由你們先發起攻擊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"互相之間要注意配合，要是不當心，那就和我一個個對付你們沒區別了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那就開始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"米格魯，盯緊了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"炎熔、克洛絲，準備......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"好~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，治療就交給你了，米格魯壓力會比較大，優先照顧她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"準備——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"放！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"慢了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speake