t":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"舉盾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"舉盾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得我剛剛是怎麼干擾你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"您格擋我的攻擊，然後撞在盾上，我就被帶到炎熔的源石技藝運行軌跡上去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果芬的行動夠快，她完全可以在我撞上你之前把我逼退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"就像第一次克洛絲做的那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你準備一個人接下我的撞擊，你可以試試三種解決方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"一，想好反擊手段，然後閃開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這會讓你的隊友在某個瞬間完全暴露在敵人面前，但只要你能伺機擊倒我，就可以快速回到防禦姿態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"二，直接架盾衝撞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"盾也是一種武器，在面對衝撞時，你也可以透過盾牌展開進攻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你需要時刻注意對方，別人沒撞到，自己一個踉蹌衝出去，把後背和隊友留給敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"三，偏轉方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你之所以會被我撞到炎熔的法術前，完全是因為你的姿態和重心讓我有這樣的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你的防禦姿勢是這樣的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"還是後退了，但沒有影響到炎熔和克洛絲的攻擊路徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，先學會這套方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你是小隊的隊長，負責指揮大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你怎麼確認隊友情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"靠感覺和觀察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"觀察？怎麼觀察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"用，用眼睛看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在你回頭瞥一眼的瞬間，你覺得敵人會不會抓住這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你們小隊的站位是根據基礎課程教材來的嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"是的教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"但，不是太嚴格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"戰場條件那麼複雜，嚴格執行才會出錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"在，教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要承擔芬的部分職責，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"但我具體要做些什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你需要成為芬背後的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你、炎熔和克洛絲的站位發生較大改變，需要告知芬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"周邊環境的變化，特別是後方變動，你需要立刻告訴她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在芬倒下的時候，你需要負責領導隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"好的教官，我試試看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛絲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"我錯了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"我不該射芙蓉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"遠程幹員的專業和分工我不太懂，就不評價了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"單論團隊配合，你做得還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你方便說一下自己在射擊對抗訓練上的表現嗎，我好做個預估。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛絲","speakerId":"char_124_kroos","isRemote":false,"text":"一般是流星姐姐來當老師，唰唰唰就把我射倒了~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛斯，別太隨便了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"流星——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，我知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都給我打起精神來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這才過了幾分鐘啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我們要用上訓練場的障礙物了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就是戰場，而戰場上的敵人可不會對你們手下留情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你們，或者我，能在這裡多活幾秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"互相加油吧，小朋友們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一小時後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，看來我沒怎麼退步，真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——時間正好，那我們今天的訓練就正式結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"恭喜恭喜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不拍手了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"對......對不起教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，一會請你們吃好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"臘腸怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我那裡剛剛到了些炎國的臘腸，用特製醬料醃過，又鮮又香，可誘人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，聽上去就很好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會太油膩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但在那之前，我得帶你們先去一趟醫療部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你們放心，我也安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米格魯","speakerId":"char_122_beagle","isRemote":false,"text":"原來卡緹她們不是被教官打進醫療部的啊，嚇死我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"當了那麼多年兵，別的不說，對付你們幾個還是有法子的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"輕重緩急，早就拿捏好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"但是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"交給你們的技巧，可都是實打實拿傷口和戰友的命換回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"要是給我發現你們哪個不好好把訣竅記腦子裡，下一次我就拿電刃和你們練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了嗎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明，明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那就出發吧，早檢查完早吃東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"眾人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（我好像忘了件事......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"（教官要我做什麼來著？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"芬，酸辣的吃嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"吃，吃啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那一會的零食啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"好，謝謝教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"都下課了，還在喊教官啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芬","speakerId":"char_123_fang","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，堅雷小姐......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"你來的正好，訓練場是你在管理吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是的，杜賓教官，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷帶的小組使用完訓練場地以後一些設施和障礙物有損毀，估計是剛剛進行了高強度對抗訓練。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"請幫我修整一下，晚上我帶預備幹員要用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我這就去辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜賓","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_120_hibisc","aliases":["芙蓉"]},{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_122_beagle","aliases":["米格魯"]},{"speakerId":"char_123_fang","aliases":["芬"]},{"speakerId":"char_124_kroos","aliases":["克洛絲"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["杜賓"]},{"speakerId":"char_260_durnar","aliases":["堅雷"]}]}
